                                            "JavaScript (by confusion with Java)."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "proscribed"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "3157db37-37e3-4fb6-92aa-3a3cb0b6d806",
                                                "sense_id": "a4e20330-42ed-32be-a2fd-e7852bb46c27",
                                                "text": "In the input tag I include the onBlur=\"myfunction()\" which checks if the field is filled (displays an alert if necessary and resets the focus). If I leave the first field I get an java alert which says that field two should have a value and then a java alert which says that field one should have a value and then a java... get the picture ?"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "90e24c1f-ffb8-45ce-a2a7-6a0fa7d1143d",
                                                "sense_id": "a4e20330-42ed-32be-a2fd-e7852bb46c27",
                                                "text": "I created an alert window using java script, but I found the fonts too small. Is there a way of controling font size and style when java alert window opens."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "Java",
